@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` constructs the `order-triage` runtime agent. The custom runtime supplies `loadCanonicalInstruction`; the factory awaits that loader with `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` and uses the returned content as the agent instruction.
+
+The factory also fixes `action` to `classify-for-human-review` and `canApproveRefunds` to `false`. This repository does not establish a provider integration, tool registration, executable input or output schema, or a repository-local implementation of the runtime-supplied instruction loader.
